Derived work
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

llm/anthropic and llm/openrouter

    Portions are derived from HewlettPackard/morpheus-copilot-plugin
    https://github.com/HewlettPackard/morpheus-copilot-plugin
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

    Specifically its project structure, Gradle build setup, and the
    session-scoped HTTP client pattern. That project does not ship a NOTICE
    file, so no upstream attribution notices are carried forward here.

cloud/proxmox-ve

    A modified version of HewlettPackard/morpheus-proxmox-ve-plugin
    https://github.com/HewlettPackard/morpheus-proxmox-ve-plugin
    Copyright 2025 Hewlett Packard Enterprise Development LP
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

    It includes the Proxmox VE 9 changes of
    ThePoshArchitect/morpheus-proxmox-ve-plugin, commit 5841b29
    https://github.com/ThePoshArchitect/morpheus-proxmox-ve-plugin
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

    The upstream project does not ship a NOTICE file. The commit history of
    cloud/proxmox-ve records every change made to the upstream files.

